<view class="editor-page">
  <view class="editor-hero"><text>{{entryId ? '编辑知识草稿' : '新建知识草稿'}}</text><text>草稿 v{{draftVersion || '-'}} · {{status === 'archived' ? '已归档' : '可编辑'}} · synthetic / unverified</text></view>
  <view class="loading card" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="section card"><text class="section-title">条目范围</text><text class="label">主题键</text><input value="{{form.topic}}" data-field="topic" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{entryId}}" placeholder="例如：implant-components"/><text class="label">范围</text><picker range="{{scopes}}" bindchange="onScopeChange" disabled="{{entryId}}"><view class="picker-value">{{form.scope === 'service' ? '服务专属' : '通用'}}</view></picker><block wx:if="{{form.scope === 'service'}}"><text class="label">服务 ID</text><input value="{{form.serviceId}}" data-field="serviceId" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{entryId}}" placeholder="关联服务 ID"/></block></view>
    <view class="section card"><text class="section-title">知识正文</text><text class="label">标题</text><input value="{{form.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="onInput"/><text class="label">正文</text><textarea class="body-input" value="{{form.body}}" data-field="body" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="20000"/><text class="label">适用范围</text><textarea value="{{form.applicability}}" data-field="applicability" bindinput="onInput"/><text class="label">中文别名（逗号或换行分隔）</text><textarea value="{{form.aliasesText}}" data-field="aliasesText" bindinput="onInput"/></view>
    <view class="source-card card"><text>来源与审核状态</text><text>来源：synthetic（模拟生成）</text><text>审核：unverified（未审核）</text><text>训练范围：demo</text><text>系统禁止模拟内容标记为 reviewed/verified，也不会生成虚假来源链接。</text></view>
    <view class="section card"><text class="section-title">模拟草稿生成</text><text class="warning">模型只生成候选，不会直接发布；生成期间的人工编辑具有优先权。</text><textarea value="{{form.generationBrief}}" data-field="generationBrief" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="可选：说明希望补充的模拟知识角度"/><button class="secondary-button action" bindtap="startGeneration" loading="{{generating}}" disabled="{{generating}}">{{generating ? '生成任务执行中' : '保存并生成候选'}}</button><view class="job-state" wx:if="{{job}}">{{job.status}} · generation {{job.generation}}<text wx:if="{{job.resultApplied === false}}"> · 候选未覆盖新草稿</text><text wx:if="{{job.errorMessage}}"> · {{job.errorMessage}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="section card" wx:if="{{entryId}}"><text class="section-title">检索预览</text><text class="label">输入学员可能提出的问题</text><input value="{{form.previewQuestion}}" data-field="previewQuestion" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="例如：这个项目多少钱，包含拍片吗？"/><text class="preview-tip">预览使用服务器上已保存的草稿，不会污染正式训练索引。</text></view>
    <view class="section card" wx:if="{{revisions.length}}"><text class="section-title">只读版本与对照</text><view class="revision" wx:for="{{revisions}}" wx:key="revisionId"><text>v{{item.version}} · {{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.publishedAt}}</text><text class="revision-body">{{item.body}}</text><text class="hash">{{item.contentHash}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="actions"><button class="primary-button action" bindtap="saveTapped" loading="{{saving}}">保存草稿</button><button class="secondary-button action" wx:if="{{entryId}}" bindtap="previewDraft">可信预览</button><button class="publish-button action" wx:if="{{entryId}}" bindtap="publishDraft">发布不可变版本</button><button class="archive-button action" wx:if="{{entryId && status !== 'archived'}}" bindtap="archiveKnowledge">归档知识</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
